  "body": "There are a number of instances in the spec were we use the terms \"session key\" and \"room key\" interchangeably to mean the symmetric key used to encrypt a set of events within a megolm session.\r\n\r\nWe also use \"session key\" to describe the ID for a UISI session, etc.\r\n\r\nWe should pick one. And as for UISI etc. sessions: use \"session ID\" instead.",
